    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Burger Kombat Kitchen!</h2>In this virtual kitchen, there is no logic \u2013 ingredients <strong>randomly appear</strong> on your table <strong>every couple hours</strong>. All you can do is hope that your culinary skills will be enough to figure out what can be prepared from them! Combine various ingredients to create new burgers and amaze everyone with your mastery of cooking from the most absurd and incompatible products.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rarer the product, the cooler the burger.</h2>Collect the <u>rarest ingredients</u> to make the most expensive burgers out of them. In the Burger Kombat's kitchen, the main indicator of a chef's mastery is the ability to make burgers that people would want to pay any amount of money for!<br><br><strong>And remember the main thing</strong> \u2013 this game will not teach you how to cook delicious burgers, it will teach you how to cook <strong>EXPENSIVE burgers</strong>.",
